<title>FRANCE: Dollar's rise reflects fundamentals - Arthuis.</title>
<headline>Dollar's rise reflects fundamentals - Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wedneday the current rise of the dollar reflected the fundamentals of economies.</p>
<p>&quot;The markets are taking into account the fundamentals,&quot; he told reporters, on leaving a weekly cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;It's necessary for the new situation to consolidate and that we avoid volatility, that is to say that there is stability,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;These factors seem to me to be favourable to growth in France,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
